{"full":"hf:mehmetkeremturkcan/boundless-nyc","spaceId":"mehmetkeremturkcan/boundless-nyc","name":"BoundlessNYC","source":"huggingface","description":"Real-time digital twin of New York City from public records","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":7,"created":"2026-09-24T19:30:48.000Z","updated":"2026-09-30T12:20:25.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://mehmetkeremturkcan-boundless-nyc.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mehmetkeremturkcan/boundless-nyc","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:59.367Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:59.367Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:59.367Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"✦","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A real-time WebGL2 rendering of BoundlessNYC, a digital twin of Manhattan, the Bronx, Brooklyn and Queens compiled from public municipal records. It includes 937,965 buildings, the street network with its recorded lane geometry, street trees and street furniture, and simulated traffic and pedestrians. The browser streams 512 m tiles within 1 km of the camera and far-field tiles within 13 km, so it loads only the neighbourhood around the camera at full detail. The full city is 2.4 GB.","Requirements. A desktop browser with WebGL2 (a current Chrome or Edge is recommended) and a discrete GPU. If mouse look does not engage inside the embedded page, open the app in its own tab.","Implementation. This Space runs no simulation server. server.mjs is a dependency-free static server. It serves the Content/ folder of the dataset mehmetkeremturkcan/boundless-nyc, mounted read-only at /data as a Space volume. All rendering and simulation run in the browser. The simulation server with the Python API (synchronous stepping, sensors, ground truth) is distributed as a desktop build; see the repository."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mehmetkeremturkcan/boundless-nyc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cfb3dd7726e93d8e6f628631031903b38a3a9d8444921433d9ccb24b275375d5","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:59.443Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:59.443Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A real-time WebGL2 rendering of BoundlessNYC, a digital twin of Manhattan, the Bronx, Brooklyn and Queens compiled from public municipal records. It includes 937,965 buildings, the street network with its recorded lane geometry, street trees and street furniture, and simulated traffic and pedestrians. The browser streams 512 m tiles within 1 km of the camera and far-field tiles within 13 km, so it loads only the neighbourhood around the camera at full detail. The full city is 2.4 GB.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mehmetkeremturkcan/boundless-nyc/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"cfb3dd7726e93d8e6f628631031903b38a3a9d8444921433d9ccb24b275375d5","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mehmetkeremturkcan/boundless-nyc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:59.443Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-30T12:20:25.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mehmetkeremturkcan/boundless-nyc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:59.443Z","hash":"cfb3dd7726e93d8e6f628631031903b38a3a9d8444921433d9ccb24b275375d5","originalBytes":2804,"storedBytes":2804,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["boundlessnyc","data","city","camera","digital","open","real-time","simulation","simulator","street","twin","app","assets","browser","compiled","desktop","full","harlem","look","mit","models","mouse","new","odbl","pedestrian","public","rendering","repository.","server","server.","space","tiles","turkcan.","webgl2","within","york","acknowledgements.md","action","alternative.","ambientcg","api","around","ave","boundless-nyc","bronx","brooklyn","browser.","build","buildings","carla","carla.org","cc0","center","chrom